# SPA history-routing fallback for Cloudflare Pages: serve index.html for any path
# so react-router client routes (/join/:slug, /kiosk/:slug, /auth, …) resolve on
# direct load / refresh. Vite copies public/ into dist/, so this lands at dist/_redirects.
# rekindlebc.com/app is the shareable way into the individual (consumer) app;
# deeper paths carry over, e.g. /app/guide → app.rekindlebc.com/guide.
/app      https://app.rekindlebc.com/         301
/app/*    https://app.rekindlebc.com/:splat   301

/*  /index.html  200
